# Qwen2.5 1.5B Instruct for the Pharma environment.
# The environment's prompts are about 1,800 tokens (rules + today's report +
# the last 3 days' results). Ollama may cut prompts longer than its default
# context window from the start, losing the rules and output format, so the
# context is raised to 8,192 tokens to leave plenty of room.
FROM qwen2.5:1.5b
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
